&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;29&quot;&gt;MS in a relevant engineering field (Electronics, Optics, Photonics, EE/CE, Systems Engineering, Applied Physics, etc.) with &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of industry experience, &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;or&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;193&quot;&gt;PhD in a similar field with &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;6+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;259&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Technical background&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;283&quot;&gt;Must have demonstrated experience in &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;electronic–photonics systems&lt;/strong&gt; (mixed-domain integration: optical, electrical, thermal, mechanical, controls).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;422&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of system integration principles: requirements, interfaces, verification, reliability, and integration/test planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
